<h1>Hello!</h1>
<p>You have successfully booked a resource: <strong>{{ resourceTitle }}</strong>.</p>
<p>Amount to be paid: <strong>${{ totalPrice }}</strong>.</p>

<div style="background-color: #fff3cd; padding: 15px; border: 1px solid #ffeeba; margin: 20px 0;">
    <strong>Attention:</strong> Please pay for your booking within {{ paymentDelay }} minutes, otherwise it will be automatically cancelled.
</div>

<p>
    <a href="{{ paymentUrl }}" style="background-color: #007bff; color: white; padding: 10px 20px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; display: inline-block;">
        Proceed to payment
    </a>
    <i style="color: #999;">
        Imitation of a button to go to the payment URL. Use the 'Client Payment' endpoint in Postman.
    </i>
</p>
